| id   | select_type | table | type  | possible_keys | key  | key_len | ref  | rows | Extra       |
+------+-------------+-------+-------+---------------+------+---------+------+------+-------------+
|    1 | PRIMARY     | t20   | range | a             | a    | 5       | NULL | 9    | Using where |
|    2 | SUBQUERY    | t10   | ALL   | NULL          | NULL | NULL    | NULL | 10   |             |
